    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d565">

                <pb facs="0482" n="366" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg366"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.516/15.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The National Bank of the Republic of Haiti to the
                        Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1914-12-11T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1914-12-10T13:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date><hi rendition="#italic">; received December 11,
                            1914.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Will you kindly have the following telegram transmitted to Port au Prince for our
                    account: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ban que Nation ale de la Republiqtte
                                d’Haiti</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Port au Prince</hi>.</p>
                        <p>Referring to our previous message, you are authorized to deliver gold to
                            Captain United States Ship <hi rendition="#italic">Machias</hi> due Port
                            au Prince fifteenth. Wire immediately amount you are shipping.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wehrhane</hi>.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">National Bank of the Republic of Haiti</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
